\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">.</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">1.(</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">월</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">) </span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">∼ </span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">9. 30.(</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">금</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">)</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1; margin-top: 3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">응모자격</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">전 국민 누구나 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">/ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">개인 또는 팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">(4</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">인 이하로 제한</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1; margin-top: 3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">응모작품</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 10pt;\">분야별 개인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 10pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 10pt;\">팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 10pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 10pt;\">당 최대 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 10pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 10pt;\">개 작품 이내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 10pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 10pt;\">선정 및 수상은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 10pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 10pt;\">편에 한함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 10pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1; margin-top: 3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">공모주제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">양주에서 보내는 일상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">명소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">여행지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">체험 등 양주시의 매력</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1; margin-left: 33.3pt; text-indent: -33.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">6. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">공모분야 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">: 2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">개 분야 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">영상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">사진</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">)</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_